          "content": {
            "size": 5113,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 4446,
            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"# Ledger rollout\\n\\nScope anchor: the ledger keeps a clock of its own in both versions.\\n\\nRetired note: the nightly mirror job runs at 02:00 every day.\\n\\nWindow anchor: the mirror keeps its retry budget in both versions.\\n\\nStep 1: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 2: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 3: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 4: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 5: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 6: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 7: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 8: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 9: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 10: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nThe retry budget is three attempts per lease.\\n\\nStep 12: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 13: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 14: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 15: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 16: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 17: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 18: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 19: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 20: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 21: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\\nStep 22: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\\n\",\"markdown_tree\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ledger rollout\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Scope anchor: the ledger keeps a clock of its own in both versions.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Retired note: the nightly mirror job runs at 02:00 every day.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Window anchor: the mirror keeps its retry budget in both versions.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 1: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 2: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 3: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 4: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 5: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 6: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 7: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 8: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 9: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 10: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The retry budget is three attempts per lease.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 12: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 13: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 14: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 15: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 16: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 17: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 18: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 19: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 20: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 21: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Step 22: the ledger writes the clock before the mirror reads it.\"}]}]},\"number\":3,\"named\":true,\"summary\":\"Drop the placeholder\",\"authors\":[{\"kind\":\"session\",\"id\":\"e2e-reading-pane\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T12:03:42.26922Z\",\"size\":1641,\"sha256\":\"c4e29cd5583229931ef16ed031bd6689a3e630d67f94bde3f4053f7b862cefdc\"}\n"
